'''Frog Prince''' is a {{Mythic}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished in [[Water]] on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Frog Prince''' can be fished up anywhere on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}} once the player is {{skill|fishing|10}}. 

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Frog Prince''' is {{Green|25}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|0.25%|1|400|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
