== Behavior ==
When caught, the '''Frog Prince''' hops towards the player while shooting projectiles. The projectiles slowly move towards the player and can turn to follow them. Upon reaching the player, they explode into a ring of fire, dealing damage. Every {{Green|3}} seconds, the '''Frog Prince''' hops {{Green|8}} blocks into the air and smashes down, also dealing damage.

